            </note>
            <note corresp="#d819-f2" n="1" xml:id="d819-f2-content">
                <p>For the recognition of the Czecho-Slovak National Council on Sept. 3, 1918, see
                        <ref target="frus1918Supp01v01"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1918, Supplement 1, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
